    <li>A target PAR of 30-50 umols is usually the "sweet spot" to maintain color without inducing algae issues.</li>
    <li>If using high light, ensure CO2 and nutrient levels are elevated to match the metabolic demand.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Water Parameters</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Stability is the most critical factor for this plant; it does not respond well to fluctuating parameters.</li>
