</head>
<body>

<h1>Bucephalandra "Black Cobra" Care Guide</h1>

<p>Bucephalandra "Black Cobra" is a sought-after variety of Bucephalandra known for its distinctive dark, sometimes almost black, coloration and unique leaf shape. It is a slow-growing plant that adds a unique touch to planted aquariums.</p>

<p>Here''s a guide to help you care for Bucephalandra "Black Cobra":</p>

