<ul>
    <li>Bucephalandra "Black Cobra" is considered an easy plant to care for, even for beginners.</li>
    <li>Maintain stable water parameters to prevent melting and rotting.</li>
    <li>Melting can occur when the plant adjusts to a new environment, but it will usually recover and produce new growth from the rhizome if the rhizome remains healthy.</li>
