    <li>However, be cautious with high lighting levels as it is a slow grower and susceptible to algae growth on its leaves.</li>
    <li> Some varieties, like ''Wavy green'', require moderate to high lighting, but it''s important to balance light intensity and duration to avoid stressing the plants or encouraging algae growth.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Water Parameters</h2>
